--- !u!114 &594054301
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 594054299}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.18039216, b: 0.36078432, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: b774760fc2dc0ce42ad3079d3c89bf49, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 28
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "<b><size=34>Vas\u0131fl\u0131 Su Ta\u015F\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131k</size></b>\n<i>Game
    Design Document \u2013 \xD6zet</i>\n\n<b>Hikaye</b>\nVas\u0131fl\u0131 Su Ta\u015F\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131k,
    kasaban\u0131n yeni kurulan su da\u011F\u0131t\u0131m firmas\u0131d\u0131r. Sen
    firman\u0131n ilk s\xFCr\xFCc\xFCs\xFCs\xFCn. Volkan ete\u011Fine, \u015Fehir
    merkezine, vadilere, karl\u0131 kasabalara ve limana 19 litrelik damacanalar\u0131
    devirmeden ula\u015Ft\u0131rarak markay\u0131 b\xF6lgenin en g\xFCvenilir su
    firmas\u0131 yapmal\u0131s\u0131n.\n\n<b>Temel Mekanik</b>\nKamyonun iki tekerle\u011Fi
    g\xF6vdeye <b>WheelJoint2D</b> ile ba\u011Fl\u0131d\u0131r. Motor (JointMotor2D)
    tekerlekleri d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCr, s\xFCspansiyon (JointSuspension2D) engebeleri
    emer. Kasadaki damacanalar ger\xE7ek fizik nesneleridir; sert s\xFCr\xFC\u015Fte
    kasadan d\xFC\u015Fer ve kaybolur.\n\n<b>Kontroller</b>\nSHIFT / \u25BA / D :
    Gaz        CTRL / BO\u015ELUK / \u25C4 / A : Fren - Geri\nHavada: Gaz = burun
    yukar\u0131, Fren = burun a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131\nESC / P : Duraklat     R : Yeniden
    ba\u015Fla\n\n<b>Kazanma / Kaybetme</b>\nTeslimat noktas\u0131na, b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn
    istedi\u011Fi oranda suyla ula\u015F. Kamyon devrilirse, yoldan \xE7\u0131karsa
    ya da su gereken oran\u0131n alt\u0131na d\xFC\u015Ferse teslimat ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z
    olur.\n\n<b>Skor ve Y\u0131ld\u0131zlar</b>\nSkor = teslim edilen litre \xD7
    10 + su oran\u0131 \xD7 1000 + zaman bonusu\n\u2605 Teslimat   \u2605 %85+ su  
    \u2605 Hedef s\xFCre\n\n<b>Oyunla\u015Ft\u0131rma \u2013 Marka G\xFCc\xFC</b>\nTeslim
    etti\u011Fin her litre firman\u0131n marka g\xFCc\xFCne eklenir ve r\xFCtben
    y\xFCkselir: Stajyer Da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131 \u2192 Mahalle Da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131s\u0131
    \u2192 B\xF6lge Sorumlusu \u2192 Lojistik \u015Eefi \u2192 Vas\u0131fl\u0131
    Su Efsanesi.\n\n<b>B\xF6l\xFCmler</b>\n1. Volkan Ete\u011Fi \u2013 volkan ve
    lav, \xF6\u011Fretici\n2. \u015Eehir Merkezi \u2013 gece, \u015Fantiye engelleri\n3.
    G\xFCn Bat\u0131m\u0131 Vadisi \u2013 dik yoku\u015Flar ve kayalar\n4. Kartopu
    Kasabas\u0131 \u2013 karl\u0131 kasaba, kaygan zemin\n5. Mavi Liman \u2013 liman/sanayi,
    en uzun ve en sert parkur\n\nTam dok\xFCman i\xE7in \"PDF'i A\xE7\" butonunu
    kullan."
